    {
      "category": "overview",
      "field": "description",
      "value": "The American Studies Bachelor's programme imparts interdisciplinary and subject-specific knowledge about forms and developments of literature, culture, and history of the USA. Various cultural productions, texts, and media in which these processes occur and are represented, the social groups and institutions involved, as well as the transcultural dimensions of American literatures, cultures, and American history are examined.",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "source": null,
